  ($q$cs-601$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Craft and Structure$q$, $q$Cross-Text Connections$q$, 2, $q$Text 1: Economist Lindqvist argues that raising the minimum wage reduces employment because firms cut jobs to offset higher labor costs.

