  ($q$cs-603$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Craft and Structure$q$, $q$Cross-Text Connections$q$, 2, $q$Text 1: Ecologist Moreno argues that reintroducing wolves restored the park's ecosystem by controlling the elk population.

