  ($q$cs-611$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Craft and Structure$q$, $q$Words in Context$q$, 1, $q$The professor's lectures were known for their ______, linking ideas from biology, economics, and art.$q$, $q$Which choice completes the text with the most logical and precise word or phrase?$q$, $q$["breadth","repetition","brevity","simplicity"]$q$::jsonb, 0, $q$Linking many fields shows breadth.$q$),
